{"unit_id":"diqierjia__StrataGate-AgentMemory#feature-1","repo":"diqierjia/StrataGate-AgentMemory","commit":"9053d3fcf75be4d59d0457404493636224aa7d0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"StrataGate 的功能「分层会话记忆」：把较早的对话以不同细节层级呈现，L0 为标题标签，L5 保留原始记录。可从会话中的 Block 检查点或区块目录调用展开工具查看更多细节。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/core/src/blocks.ts:91-107","src/tools.ts:187-208"]}
{"unit_id":"diqierjia__StrataGate-AgentMemory#feature-2","repo":"diqierjia/StrataGate-AgentMemory","commit":"9053d3fcf75be4d59d0457404493636224aa7d0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"StrataGate 的功能「长期事实检索」：将对话中的长期事实作为 Event 搜索，支持主题范围、时间顺序和参与者等筛选；结果可展开查看完整事件来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:114-135","src/tools.ts:210-217"]}
